/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The past year presents a complex financial landscape shaped by monetary policy shifts and technological advancement, as 2024 was characterised by persistent inflation challenges and evolving monetary policies across major economies. This past month specifically, December 2024, reflects rapid transformation, driven by fintech innovation and financial inclusion initiatives, with mobile money transactions exceeding $850 billion for the year, marking a 15% increase from 2023 \(GSMA, 2024\), while traditional banks expanded partnerships with fintech firms to enhance digital services.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
