/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Billboxx secures $1.6mn pre-seed funding to tackle SME cash flow in Africa: Billboxx is a financial technology platform, founded in Nigeria in 2023, designed to streamline invoicing and payment processes for businesses, particularly SMEs. It offers creative solutions to improve cash flow and offer credit facilities by promoting faster collections, efficient vendor payouts and automated reconciliations. Last month, Billboxx aimed to empower SMEs through their latest investment into addressing the cash flow challenges faced by SMEs in Africa; reinforcing their internal operations, whilst mitigating financial burdens.  )
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
