187 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This investment tackles the significant issue of delayed payments for goods and services, which negatively impacts the cash flows of these SMEs. Delayed payments can impact business operations, lead to financial instability and potential bankruptcy. Billboxx aims to tackle this problem by providing a platform which  automates invoicing ensuring prompt payments; thereby enabling SMEs to divert more resources towards managing and scaling their business. This marks a transformative moment for African SMEs, as this  enhanced stability and financial reliability will allow them to attract greater foreign investment.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
